title: shared operator identifiability (v0)
message: If you use this software or its results, please cite it.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-14
repository-code: "https://github.com/tue-bmd/multiphysics-ultrasound-models"
url: "https://github.com/tue-bmd/multiphysics-ultrasound-models/tree/main/studies/03-shared-operator-identifiability"
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  A v0 study of information transfer through a shared image-domain measurement
  operator. A calibrated relation between sequence-specific image widths is
  tested as a means of reducing confounding between intrinsic lesion-margin
  width and B-mode image blur.
keywords:
  - quantitative ultrasound
  - inverse problems
  - identifiability
  - uncertainty quantification
  - contrast-enhanced ultrasound
  - shear wave elastography
